"**Description**: Get detailed glycoprotein information from GlyGen by "
"UniProt accession. Returns protein name, glycosylation sites (N-linked, "
"O-linked), site positions, attached glycan structures, and associated "
"diseases/pathways. Essential for studying protein glycosylation. Example:"
" P14210 (Hepatocyte Growth Factor) has 77 glycosylation annotations."
msgstr ""

